{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>My son, if you accept</b> — Then you will understand the righteousness of those mentioned at the beginning of the book. And when you grasp this place and say: 'when wisdom enters' — it enters to you, like a man to his house." "<b>Understanding will guard you</b> — to deliver you from the strange woman."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:48.376230533Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}